{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! All obligations are now VERIFIED. The certificate shows:\n- Total farmers markets: 7,944 ✓\n- US population: 341,784,857 ✓\n- Farmers markets per 100,000 residents: 2.3243 ✓\n\nThe witnesses are:\n- verify-total_farmers_markets (sha256:1160c3c23236a96a)\n- verify-us_population (sha256:924bc1bdc639efa2)\n- verify-farmers_markets_per_100k (sha256:f35d070a54c8a6af)\n\nNow let me also verify the lineage of the metric alias to ensure all sources are properly tracked.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_018LtEMRnHzAtYVdpZowLoCh","name":"xorq_check_lineage","arguments":{"catalog_path":".xorq/catalog","alias":"farmers-markets-per-100k","no_local":true}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":12,"output":280,"cacheRead":20644,"cacheWrite":824,"totalTokens":21760,"cost":{"input":0.000012,"output":0.0014000000000000002,"cacheRead":0.0020644,"cacheWrite":0.00103,"total":0.004506400000000001},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":169},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786914624970,"responseId":"msg_011Ce77YvtDWvFhyqRewFQDw","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_018LtEMRnHzAtYVdpZowLoCh","toolName":"xorq_check_lineage","content":[{"type":"text","text":" ✅ VERIFIED   lineage · farmers-markets-per-100k  ·  2 sources\n   ✓ lineage reaches a source from its root\n   ✓ read_csv(https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv)  via pandas\n   ✓ read_csv(https://gist.githubusercontent.com/hussainsultan/369600f5179b22792a2b4c9ed37de056/raw/NST-EST2025-ALLDATA.csv)  via pandas"}],"details":{"alias":"farmers-markets-per-100k","sources":[{"node":"@read_3f612b18e608","op":"Read","method":"read_csv","path":"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv","table":"farmers_markets","profile":"beee580ceeacddc83bd6914e17f47319_0","con_na